# Live slots: reaching one opens the search it carries, what's shown in it
# is remembered, and once something's on stage the arrows step its slides
# even with text still in the search box.
section 15 Alabanza
add fixtures/video.mp4
slot !b juan 3:16-18
add fixtures/image.png
wait 1500
press pagedown
wait 800
press pagedown
wait 1500
shot 1-slot-opened
press enter
wait 400
press enter
wait 600
shot 2-shown
press right
wait 400
shot 3-next-verse
